              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kikwong’io mising’ sigikyik: ak king’at inendet ichek kolenji, amomwachi chi age tugul kit ne kagoyaak.",
          "type": "text",
